<p>This is a thing too much like other things.</p>
<p>Also, as much as I see the appeal&#8212; I'm getting really tired of the &quot;excuse to make a list of whimsical creatures/items/events&quot; SCPs. It's too easy. Fun, yes. But <em>easy</em>, if there is nothing else that makes the SCP stand out. It just becomes a container for things that wouldn't be acceptable SCPs on their own.</p>

